L258: ## Description
L259: ### General description
L260: 
L261: N-Z-Amine A is a peptone containing amino acids and peptides derived by the enzymatic hydrolysis of casein protein. N-Z-Amine A may be used as a plant media growth supplement and in microbiological work.
L262: 
L263: ### Application
L264: 
L265: N-Z-Amine® A has been used:
L266: 
L267:   * as a component in MS media add this for in in vitro shoot multiplication[1]
L268:   * as a component in MS media add this for callus induction[2]
L269:   * as a component in N6-basal medium for immature zygotic embryos culturing[3]
L270: ### Legal Information
L271: 
L272: N-Z-Amine is a registered trademark of Kerry Group
L273: 
